    </fieldSets>
    <fields>
        <fullName>CRM_Business_Challenge_Txt__c</fullName>
        <description>Summarize in two to three sentences the specific challenge(s) the customer was facing. Outline business objectives, pain points, customer&apos;s competitive threats, and any digital transformation or sustainability goals. Give as many details as possible.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>Summarize the customer&apos;s challenges in two to three sentences. Outline business objectives, pain points, competitive threats, and digital transformation or sustainability goals.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Customer’s Business Challenge</label>
        <length>2500</length>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
        <trackHistory>true</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>LongTextArea</type>
        <visibleLines>5</visibleLines>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>CRM_Cust_Business_Results_Outcomes_Txt__c</fullName>
        <description>Summarize in two to three sentences the tangible business value the customer achieved. Address Business Transformation. If available, please provide quantifiable, measurable, and meaningful business results and key customer benefits. Ex: 15% earlier detection of sepsis with 60% greater accuracy.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>Summarize the tangible business value the customer achieved in two to three sentences.Please provide quantifiable, measurable, and meaningful business results and key customer benefits if available</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Customer&apos;s Business Results/ Outcomes</label>
        <length>2500</length>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
        <trackHistory>true</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>LongTextArea</type>
        <visibleLines>5</visibleLines>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>CRM_Customer_Willingness__c</fullName>
        <description>Your nomination and customer details will be kept internal only. However, do you believe your customer would be willing to share their story publicly?</description>
        <label>Customer Willingness</label>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
        <trackHistory>true</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Picklist</type>
        <valueSet>
            <restricted>true</restricted>
            <valueSetDefinition>
                <sorted>false</sorted>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Yes</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Yes</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Yes – No Formal Agreement</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Yes – No Formal Agreement</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>Unsure</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>Unsure</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>No – Customer Seems Unwilling</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>No – Customer Seems Unwilling</label>
                </value>
                <value>
                    <fullName>No</fullName>
                    <default>false</default>
                    <label>No</label>
                </value>
            </valueSetDefinition>
        </valueSet>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>CRM_Sales_Insights_Txt__c</fullName>
        <description>During this deal win, design win, or POC, what did you learn that your peers would benefit most from?</description>
        <inlineHelpText>During this win, what did you learn that your peers would benefit most from?</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Sales Insights</label>
        <length>2500</length>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
        <trackHistory>true</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>LongTextArea</type>
        <visibleLines>5</visibleLines>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>CRM_Solution_Summary_Txt__c</fullName>
        <description>Summarize in two to three sentences the solution that the customer chose in context with their pain points. Provide details of the solution including the use case and/or workload along with any notable partner (OEM, ISV, SI, etc.) components. If the win was proof of concept, address deployment timeline or intended next steps.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>Summarize the customer&apos;s solution in context with their pain points in two to three sentences. Provide details of the solution, including the use case/workload and any significant partner involvement.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Solution Summary</label>
        <length>2500</length>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
        <trackHistory>true</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>LongTextArea</type>
        <visibleLines>5</visibleLines>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>CRM_Why_Intel_Txt__c</fullName>
        <description>List the major factors around why the customer chose Intel.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>List the major factors around why the customer chose Intel.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Why Intel</label>
        <length>2500</length>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
        <trackHistory>true</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>LongTextArea</type>
        <visibleLines>5</visibleLines>
    </fields>
